    "blurb": "Document storage with GCS",
    "overview": "Connect Camunda processes to Google Cloud Storage to upload and download files easily. Ideal for cloud-based document management and automation scenarios.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Manage files on Google Cloud Storage",
    "splashDescription": "This connector enables you to upload files to and download files from Google Cloud Storage (GCS) as a part of Camunda-based business processes. Whether you need to store process artifacts, transfer documents, or automate data exchange, this connector provides a reliable bridge between Camunda and GCS. With simple configuration and secure access via service accounts, you can connect processes to GCS in minutes.",
